WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Zinger

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
queen

00:01:13.060 --> 02:01:37.060
AZALEA

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:25.880
Hwajin.

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:27.780
Hwajin.

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:40.030
Why are you lying there?

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:45.700
- I got it, I’m going for help.
-No.

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:49.440
No one should know that I...

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:52.770
What am I...

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:55.180
Hold on.

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:02.280
Episode 10

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:06.490
Why did you go there, where there are such terrible memories?

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:08.860
Are you sure you can’t call anyone?

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:11.290
What if he ends up dying?

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:16.460
Are you having nightmares again?

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:19.030
Hey, wake up.

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:26.340
Hwajin.

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:30.910
Great. Think what you want.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.390
It won't do. I'll go find someone.

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:45.030
Well, here you are again.

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:46.830
I had a nightmare

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.230
that I died a worthless king.

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:55.070
Scary nightmare where am I

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:59.870
watched the world collapse

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:03.910
and couldn't do anything.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:08.820
Nobody asked.

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:13.650
Let's lie like this for a while.

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:17.020
Just a moment.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:28.270
I'll pretend to be Hwajin for a moment.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:42.950
Episode 10: Living in a Nightmare

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:46.520
You have finally become queen.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.120
I knew this would happen.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.550
Secret

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:55.660
I will tell His Majesty everything.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:58.260
So that the past no longer affects us.

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:07.830
Your Highness.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.240
I need to talk to His Majesty.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:14.710
The king and queen came out

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:17.010
and even Mr. Kim is not at home.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:09.000
Ovol.

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:13.300
I can help the king and destroy the queen.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:15.800
What should I do?

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:02.020
Your Majesty.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:09.590
It's time to wash.

00:07:58.570 --> 00:07:59.710
Good morning.

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:05.310
-What happened?
-Good question.

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:08.280
I almost touched you... That is, I almost died.

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:10.450
You're so heavy.

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:14.620
It was dangerous.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:19.030
There was no accounting book there.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.130
You saved me

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:23.700
yourself?

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:28.130
You didn't want me to call for help.

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:33.240
I had to strain all my strength.

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:40.750
I can. Remember the day when you had to lift 150 kg.

00:08:41.610 --> 00:08:43.350
Strength is not in muscles

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:46.950
but in determination.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:56.060
Why did you climb into the well at such a time?

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:02.900
It was dark, I couldn’t see well, and I fell through.

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:06.040
Do you have night blindness?

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.840
It is difficult to climb out of the well.

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:12.150
Are you awake?

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:14.510
Wait.

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:19.290
Come here. Quicker.

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:21.620
Wait a moment.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.960
Sign in.

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:43.740
If I knew you would stay in the main house,

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:46.580
I would have prepared a bigger bed.

00:09:46.780 --> 00:09:50.420
Dad, no! No need, dad!

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:53.250
Dad! Don't do this!

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.720
No! Dad!

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:56.990
Daddy!

00:09:57.060 --> 00:09:58.620
I'm sorry.

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:00.490
No need.

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:03.060
Thanks to your efforts

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:04.600
I felt comfortable here.

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:08.630
No need to bother you anymore
I'll go back to the palace.

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:12.710
What does "trouble" mean? Don't say that.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:16.180
I came to deliver a message

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:18.640
the dowager queen.

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:27.020
She sends for you every day, which means

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.720
She really really needs you.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:33.890
Everything in the palace goes wrong without me.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:37.230
Well.

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:41.100
Even if you're busy and tired, that's good.

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:45.840
Don't worry about anything, focus on being the queen.

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:49.610
I may not be the best father, but remember,

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:51.380
I will always support you.

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:55.550
Yes.

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:00.590
Arrive safely at the palace.

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:04.960
I understand that this is impudent, but I ask you to take care of the queen.

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:11.630
I will pay more attention to her, she will not be lonely.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:15.640
What a blessing. I'm so grateful and embarrassed.

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:18.540
Can we go?

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:35.920
Portrays a caring dad

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:39.430
and he himself is just a grabber who uses his own child for profit.

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:44.460
He gave his daughter away to someone he himself tried to kill.

00:11:47.070 --> 00:11:49.200
Is that why the king wanted to kill Kim Soyeon?

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:54.810
Why do you look like you've lost your country?

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:56.610
This is wrong.

00:11:57.080 --> 00:12:00.350
If not a country, then something else?

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.480
Wait, really lost?

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:04.680
Of course not.

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:08.750
On such a beautiful day you return safely to the palace.

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:12.490
Despite the face, I'm very happy.

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:15.160
Okay, if that's the case.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:20.630
Isn't it time for the blood feud to begin?

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:26.440
But it seems like I forgot something important.

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:30.280
It seems I had an important mission...

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:32.850
What a handsome guy.

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:35.010
He's so handsome.

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:36.920
Really handsome.

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:47.760
Selection of royal concubines.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:50.060
How could I forget about such a great thing?

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.060
I have something important to do, so that's it for now.

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:53.600
Hong Young, let's go. Quicker.

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:55.840
Wait. Why are you running away?

00:12:55.970 --> 00:12:57.140
I'm sorry.

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.170
Take your time.

00:13:00.510 --> 00:13:03.040
Here's a quick one. Queen.

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:06.910
Your Majesty.

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:17.620
Let's go.

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:34.540
-Where is the chief eunuch?
-I checked, he's busy.

00:13:35.070 --> 00:13:36.480
You couldn't find her?

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.140
The book seemed to disappear into thin air.

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.680
Maybe my father-in-law guessed and hid it?

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:44.350
Not the case.

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:46.890
His behavior did not change until I left.

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:50.260
And he definitely doesn’t know how to hide his feelings.

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:52.190
So this was the one?

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:54.560
In a mask from the Detective Department.

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:58.630
If the ledger fell into the hands of Kim Jwageun, we won't see it again.

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:00.630
He has no way of knowing where she was moved.

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:02.500
It's such a thing

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:04.900
that your father-in-law won't be able to tell anyone that he lost her.

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:07.170
He will have to suffer alone.

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:10.880
He will start looking for the ledger.

00:14:12.310 --> 00:14:13.750
And he will do it himself.

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:15.380
Let them follow him.

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:16.520
Eat.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.990
I think finding her is a lost cause.

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:20.450
It's time to give up.

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:22.820
Without a ledger, all our plans are in vain.

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:26.190
I won't give up so easily.

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:31.060
Act like a queen here, be polite.

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:32.930
Hurry up, let's go.

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:35.770
Your Majesty!

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:37.670
Hello, Court Lady Choi!

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:44.080
Your Majesty.

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:46.780
I missed you so much.

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:50.480
Court lady Choi.
Bring all the Joseon girls here.

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:53.750
And don't miss the Han family register,

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:54.850
bring it to me.

00:14:56.090 --> 00:14:58.890
I begin to select royal concubines.

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:02.860
Under the pretext of choosing concubines, I will study this family.

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:05.900
The choice of royal concubines is the solution.

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:11.270
Yes, that's right, I need to greet the Queen Dowager.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.670
Well wait.

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:16.480
The soul of Jang Bong-hwan and the memories of Kim So-yeon -

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:19.880
the perfect mixture to create
flawless queen.

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:25.020
Your Majesty.

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:27.720
Are you okay?

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:30.790
Has anything changed?

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.230
You look different.

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:37.030
I was able to start over
after returning home.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:39.400
This is good.

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:41.830
I'm sorry for making you so worried.

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:46.110
And thank you that despite this,

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:47.770
you understood me so well.

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:52.240
To atone for what happened in the past,

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:55.250
I will try hard

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:57.320
play the role of queen.

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:01.120
So you'll get started
to the most important things immediately?

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:02.920
Now I know exactly what I'm talking about.

00:16:03.490 --> 00:16:06.290
As soon as I felt better, I came

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:09.030
to do this.

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:10.800
As expected.

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:12.730
I was only gone for a couple of days

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:15.770
but I couldn't help but think about it.

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:18.740
So we have the same feelings?

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:20.940
-Then...
-Right now...

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:22.210
-From this moment?
-Shall we start?

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:24.210
-Queen.
-Good work!

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:32.250
That's not what I was thinking about at all.

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:41.430
Your Majesty.

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:45.060
I look forward to your teaching.

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:50.470
Apparently I'm irreplaceable.

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:51.970
I can't believe I'm sharing recipes.

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:55.210
I'm not ready to become a teacher.

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:59.150
What's the matter? Out of the way.

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:04.850
Mommies.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:09.190
You can come here whenever you want.

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:11.520
But I'm afraid it won't work out that way.

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:36.380
Your Highness.

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:39.320
His Majesty returned to the palace.

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:41.090
Is it true?

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:42.820
Should we go to Seonjeongjeong Hall?

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:45.620
No. Let's go to the royal estate.

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:57.140
Hey, the fire is too low.

00:17:57.140 --> 00:17:58.600
So everything will turn into mush.

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:05.950
Hey, flames are everywhere.

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:11.180
There is also a flame in your eyes.

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:13.090
This can't be true.

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:14.820
I am determined to learn from you,

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:17.490
That's why my eyes sparkle with delight.

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:20.330
By the way, when will you teach me the recipe?

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:23.130
I'm sure you know how it is in the kitchen
everything is arranged. Don't do that.

00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:24.800
For those new to Chinese restaurants

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:26.630
During the first month you are only allowed to peel onions.

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:27.830
Watch the fire.

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:31.340
After all, I'm in the royal kitchen
I have been working for 30 years.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:33.510
And 12 years as a royal chef.

00:18:33.510 --> 00:18:35.240
I don't need a resume.

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:37.440
Why not start counting the days then?

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:41.750
I don't like your attitude.

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.480
Forget it.

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:45.080
Your Majesty.

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:46.550
But like this? Is that better?

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:50.220
Better? Like this.

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:51.560
Hey, open up.

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:55.090
To the side.

00:19:04.440 --> 00:19:05.770
Have you looked now?

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:07.770
Here's an industrial spy.

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:10.610
It was interesting
Is the heat adjusted correctly?

00:19:10.610 --> 00:19:12.950
You don't need to think.
I can handle this myself.

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.920
Why do you constantly go too far?

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.200
Kukbap is a traditional food of the common people.

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:34.500
And the komtan is of high society.

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:43.440
I'll add some meat broth,
Beef kukbap in French.

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:47.950
I'll get rid of the gamey taste
with the help of proteins.

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:54.390
Uses egg whites in a whole new way.

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:57.820
Your Majesty.

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:00.560
Will this work?

00:20:00.560 --> 00:20:02.190
Great.

00:20:02.190 --> 00:20:06.000
You can find out what kind of food
are you trying to cook?

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:08.230
I eat food that touches the soul.

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:11.500
Soul?

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:28.850
Great.

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:31.220
And the finishing touch.

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:36.800
-They're ready, right?
-Yes, Your Majesty.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.970
"If the foam dies, I will die too."

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:46.970
With this attitude, try
save food and act quickly.

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:48.910
So. Forward!

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:50.280
-Yes, Your Majesty.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

00:20:51.110 --> 00:20:52.210
Faster.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:58.150
She'll like it even more
because he knows the taste.

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:02.860
Your Majesty!

00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:07.290
Damhyang!

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:14.330
I was so scared
that I won't be able to see you again.

00:21:16.300 --> 00:21:19.670
Is it true. Thank you very much.

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:23.880
I made you worry.

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:26.850
I should be scolded.

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:30.620
Excuse me.

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:43.060
What...

00:21:44.830 --> 00:21:47.170
I'm not imagining it?

00:21:47.830 --> 00:21:49.800
Is this rice and soup?

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:53.940
I also think it's rice.

00:21:55.110 --> 00:21:57.710
Did she give me a kukbap?

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:01.410
For royal meals
you need to separate the rice and soup.

00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:03.850
How dare you put rice in soup,
like some peasant?

00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:05.950
Should I take it away?

00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:07.090
Certainly!

00:22:10.190 --> 00:22:11.290
But

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:15.090
the queen put a lot of effort into this.

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:19.600
I'll at least try.

00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:21.130
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:40.120
I was counting the days of my career

00:22:41.020 --> 00:22:43.160
in the royal kitchen.

00:22:43.620 --> 00:22:46.230
And lived a noble life
like a royal chef.

00:22:47.890 --> 00:22:52.870
But I became an ordinary servant
who watches the fire all night.

00:22:54.900 --> 00:22:57.070
All because of the queen.

00:22:57.940 --> 00:22:59.670
It's not because I'm a bad cook.

00:23:00.140 --> 00:23:03.040
This is because the queen is extraordinarily beautiful.

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:04.080
Damn it.

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:06.610
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:13.820
Damn it.

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:16.760
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:27.800
-And you?
-And you?

00:23:33.210 --> 00:23:35.010
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:37.110
You are too cruel!

00:23:37.110 --> 00:23:39.080
The milk hasn't dried on your lips yet!

00:23:39.080 --> 00:23:40.280
That's a small one...

00:23:40.950 --> 00:23:42.550
Damn you!

00:23:42.550 --> 00:23:44.420
Do you think I'm a joke?

00:23:44.420 --> 00:23:46.750
I'm a damn great cook!

00:23:50.760 --> 00:23:52.930
Wow, exactly what we need.

00:23:59.570 --> 00:24:01.130
When did you manage to get so close?

00:24:01.830 --> 00:24:03.470
I can't stand her that much.

00:24:06.140 --> 00:24:07.740
She attacked me just now.

00:24:07.740 --> 00:24:10.280
I must be rotten
like spoiled vegetables in summer.

00:24:11.080 --> 00:24:13.210
I blew on the fire all day.

00:24:18.320 --> 00:24:19.690
What are you doing?

00:24:20.190 --> 00:24:22.490
No. I didn't try to kiss.

00:24:22.490 --> 00:24:24.520
-I tried to explain to you...
-Away!

00:24:25.920 --> 00:24:27.530
-I...
-Go away.

00:24:30.760 --> 00:24:31.830
Fine.

00:24:32.870 --> 00:24:33.930
Sorry.

00:24:34.930 --> 00:24:36.240
There you go.

00:24:41.310 --> 00:24:43.340
I cannot insult Her Majesty,

00:24:43.910 --> 00:24:45.910
to not be on the same level as him.

00:24:46.480 --> 00:24:48.610
But I need to unwind.

00:24:50.320 --> 00:24:54.120
I was really going to stop this.

00:25:17.480 --> 00:25:19.850
Where is his face from?

00:25:30.890 --> 00:25:33.930
No no!

00:25:33.930 --> 00:25:36.030
No. No need.

00:25:37.430 --> 00:25:40.230
No! No! This cannot be!

00:25:42.510 --> 00:25:45.850
Dowager Queen,
The Queen requests an audience.

00:25:46.050 --> 00:25:47.250
Let him come in.

00:25:57.430 --> 00:25:58.700
I'm done.

00:25:59.360 --> 00:26:02.300
Of course, so heartless
will not appreciate food for the soul.

00:26:05.540 --> 00:26:07.740
Your Majesty.

00:26:08.810 --> 00:26:11.540
I must have lost my skills because

00:26:11.540 --> 00:26:14.150
I was absent from the kitchen for some time.

00:26:18.150 --> 00:26:20.020
It tastes familiar yet exotic at the same time.

00:26:20.550 --> 00:26:22.450
Familiar yet exotic.

00:26:23.420 --> 00:26:25.920
Your outstanding culinary talents
are starting to scare me.

00:26:27.160 --> 00:26:29.960
You even gave me back
long forgotten memories.

00:26:30.960 --> 00:26:32.130
Here.

00:26:36.800 --> 00:26:39.000
Good girl, eat.

00:26:40.910 --> 00:26:41.970
Mama.

00:26:45.410 --> 00:26:46.480
Your Majesty.

00:26:48.310 --> 00:26:51.020
-You have some rice here.
-How dare you!

00:26:57.920 --> 00:27:01.360
But I heard that you don't want
share your skills.

00:27:01.590 --> 00:27:04.500
You think you can't
train the royal chef?

00:27:05.100 --> 00:27:06.160
Well...

00:27:06.830 --> 00:27:09.570
This old man is getting on my nerves a little.

00:27:09.670 --> 00:27:12.470
Then you need to get rid of it immediately.

00:27:12.800 --> 00:27:14.740
In addition, there was an incident with arsenic.

00:27:16.010 --> 00:27:17.240
Arsenic?

00:27:17.540 --> 00:27:18.980
You didn't know?

00:27:18.980 --> 00:27:20.750
You've fallen into a vegetative state

00:27:20.750 --> 00:27:23.120
because I swallowed it
poison in the royal kitchen.

00:27:23.520 --> 00:27:24.550
Poison?

00:27:24.950 --> 00:27:27.590
Then I wouldn’t have recovered so quickly.

00:27:28.420 --> 00:27:30.420
The royal cook is a narrow-minded old man,

00:27:30.990 --> 00:27:33.560
but if you relieve him of his post...

00:27:33.560 --> 00:27:35.090
Will I be relieved of my position?

00:27:36.460 --> 00:27:38.560
We will behead him.

00:27:47.110 --> 00:27:49.570
I wonder who has the ledger now?

00:27:50.640 --> 00:27:51.780
And more importantly,

00:27:52.410 --> 00:27:54.480
why did he take her?

00:27:56.480 --> 00:27:58.420
Will this backfire on us?

00:27:59.220 --> 00:28:00.820
Or will he help us?

00:28:02.320 --> 00:28:04.720
He will lose his position or his head,

00:28:05.120 --> 00:28:06.390
what do I care?

00:28:07.930 --> 00:28:10.260
People ask me to share recipes

00:28:10.260 --> 00:28:12.230
This means that talk of overthrow is not a joke.

00:28:13.400 --> 00:28:15.600
It's not the old guy I have to worry about.

00:28:15.600 --> 00:28:17.100
I'm about to lose my head.

00:28:19.940 --> 00:28:22.610
Oh Cheoljong!

00:28:27.080 --> 00:28:30.120
Your Majesty, the Queen is here.

00:28:49.940 --> 00:28:51.300
What are you doing?

00:28:51.300 --> 00:28:53.740
I'm told this is how royalty walk.

00:28:54.070 --> 00:28:57.210
I'm your perfect queen.

00:28:57.740 --> 00:28:59.540
What? Who said?

00:29:00.750 --> 00:29:02.750
Lady Choi. Deceived?

00:29:02.750 --> 00:29:03.850
No, I mean...

00:29:04.180 --> 00:29:06.650
Who is my ideal queen?

00:29:07.890 --> 00:29:10.760
I am, as you can see.

00:29:14.090 --> 00:29:16.800
You're scaring me. Be the same as always.

00:29:18.260 --> 00:29:21.600
By the way, what kind of women do you like?

00:29:21.700 --> 00:29:24.440
Sexy? Lovely? Innocent?

00:29:25.940 --> 00:29:27.240
What are you talking about?

00:29:28.470 --> 00:29:29.840
The Queen Dowager said

00:29:29.840 --> 00:29:31.210
choose concubines for you.

00:29:31.840 --> 00:29:33.480
Your concubines

00:29:33.480 --> 00:29:35.110
so which ones do you prefer?

00:29:35.710 --> 00:29:36.820
Concubines?

00:29:37.750 --> 00:29:38.920
Royal concubines...

00:29:39.350 --> 00:29:40.920
What a fool.

00:29:41.650 --> 00:29:44.290
Are you showing your true colors?

00:29:48.530 --> 00:29:50.430
Great idea.

00:30:11.550 --> 00:30:14.090
Sorry. I was too happy.

00:30:14.550 --> 00:30:15.590
Well.

00:30:16.220 --> 00:30:17.890
Let's be clear.

00:30:18.460 --> 00:30:19.890
You're a king, but that doesn't mean

00:30:19.890 --> 00:30:22.890
that they belong to you. It's old fashioned.

00:30:22.890 --> 00:30:24.560
They are not yours.

00:30:26.400 --> 00:30:27.630
Great advice.

00:30:27.830 --> 00:30:29.970
-This means that...
-They are mine.

00:30:30.200 --> 00:30:31.870
-What?
-They belong to me.

00:30:32.640 --> 00:30:34.810
Don't go near the harem.

00:30:35.440 --> 00:30:37.410
You have a main concubine.

00:30:37.910 --> 00:30:39.140
It's clear.

00:30:40.380 --> 00:30:43.050
On one condition.

00:30:44.380 --> 00:30:45.980
-In your ear.
-What? For what?

00:30:45.980 --> 00:30:47.350
Everything is fine.

00:30:49.920 --> 00:30:51.460
I will choose their kind.

00:30:52.090 --> 00:30:53.160
What?

00:30:53.530 --> 00:30:57.400
No! I need looks, not pedigree.

00:30:57.900 --> 00:31:01.130
Then I will tell the queen dowager,

00:31:01.130 --> 00:31:03.940
that I don't need concubines.

00:31:03.940 --> 00:31:05.340
Fine.

00:31:05.340 --> 00:31:07.940
Just let's not violate other people's borders.

00:31:08.270 --> 00:31:10.610
Behind me is the appearance, you check their families.

00:31:11.680 --> 00:31:14.510
You are my true anti-fan.

00:31:16.180 --> 00:31:19.720
I was worried, but now I have found a solution.

00:31:24.760 --> 00:31:25.860
Don't smile.

00:31:27.760 --> 00:31:29.190
You can't smile.

00:31:29.290 --> 00:31:31.560
And you can't grab my hand

00:31:31.560 --> 00:31:33.130
and lie on my stomach!

00:31:35.030 --> 00:31:36.570
So I can't do anything?

00:31:36.570 --> 00:31:38.300
Exactly. Everything is prohibited.

00:31:38.300 --> 00:31:39.870
Don't do anything!

00:31:42.210 --> 00:31:43.710
There's no time for that.

00:31:46.080 --> 00:31:47.110
Let's go.

00:31:50.680 --> 00:31:52.480
This is my queen.

00:31:53.690 --> 00:31:56.490
Will you speak to His Majesty?

00:31:58.420 --> 00:32:00.130
I'll go back to my place.

00:32:04.830 --> 00:32:06.600
Is this what you were looking for?

00:32:10.540 --> 00:32:12.340
Did the court maid sell it to you?

00:32:12.340 --> 00:32:15.210
Yes, she's so young.

00:32:16.270 --> 00:32:18.840
She was dressed as a court maid.

00:32:18.840 --> 00:32:20.180
Remember what she looked like?

00:32:20.510 --> 00:32:23.750
Depends on how much you pay.

00:32:25.350 --> 00:32:26.950
I'll be back with the artist.

00:32:26.950 --> 00:32:29.090
The clearer your memories,

00:32:29.650 --> 00:32:31.160
the more I will offer.

00:32:44.270 --> 00:32:45.400
Welcome.

00:32:53.410 --> 00:32:55.080
Break

00:33:00.490 --> 00:33:02.820
It's fake, I'm sure of it.

00:33:02.990 --> 00:33:05.120
Are these fake documents?

00:33:05.120 --> 00:33:07.490
These are not completely false identities.

00:33:07.490 --> 00:33:11.230
These are restored documents of the deceased or missing.

00:33:12.200 --> 00:33:14.830
It wasn't done clumsily.

00:33:15.930 --> 00:33:18.800
It was probably very expensive.

00:33:25.110 --> 00:33:26.710
Thank you.

00:33:31.850 --> 00:33:33.750
So much effort

00:33:34.920 --> 00:33:37.160
to become a low-ranking official?

00:33:55.840 --> 00:33:59.980
Your Majesty, I must give you something secretly.

00:34:00.480 --> 00:34:02.710
I'll be waiting at our usual place.

00:34:04.280 --> 00:34:05.450
Your Highness.

00:34:12.620 --> 00:34:15.490
Prince Yeonpyeong left the palace.

00:34:18.930 --> 00:34:22.500
Then take this to His Majesty.

00:34:22.870 --> 00:34:23.900
Yes.

00:34:28.470 --> 00:34:30.240
Does she have something for the king?

00:34:31.240 --> 00:34:34.750
Since she couldn't give it to him after seeing how well he got along with the queen,

00:34:35.310 --> 00:34:38.020
looks like it's something special.

00:34:40.650 --> 00:34:43.660
Royal audience in 15 minutes?

00:34:43.990 --> 00:34:44.990
Yes.

00:34:45.020 --> 00:34:46.590
Get some rest.

00:34:47.130 --> 00:34:48.160
Fine.

00:34:56.170 --> 00:34:58.900
The main concubine wrote you a letter.

00:35:31.540 --> 00:35:33.170
In person

00:35:42.510 --> 00:35:45.980
While I was away, you didn't stop working.

00:35:45.980 --> 00:35:47.990
Thanks to you, I have nothing to do here.

00:35:48.250 --> 00:35:51.560
-Thank you, Your Majesty.
-Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:35:52.390 --> 00:35:54.460
To show my gratitude,

00:35:54.460 --> 00:35:56.860
I will give a feast on Cart Day.

00:35:57.460 --> 00:35:59.660
People have a lot of complaints
including natural disasters.

00:35:59.660 --> 00:36:02.230
Your generosity will make people think

00:36:02.230 --> 00:36:04.440
that we are not interested in the order

00:36:04.440 --> 00:36:07.170
and we only want to have feasts.

00:36:07.170 --> 00:36:10.910
I think a king should not behave like this.

00:36:11.080 --> 00:36:12.910
However, Yeongjo

00:36:12.910 --> 00:36:15.410
celebrated his recovery,

00:36:15.410 --> 00:36:17.650
having arranged a sumptuous feast.

00:36:18.680 --> 00:36:21.950
The Queen was exhausted from hard work

00:36:21.950 --> 00:36:23.660
and came out of a vegetative state.

00:36:24.020 --> 00:36:25.520
We need to celebrate this.

00:36:25.720 --> 00:36:29.230
We are still looking for the cause of her illness.

00:36:29.460 --> 00:36:31.900
At the moment it is not installed.

00:36:31.900 --> 00:36:34.770
She fully recovered after two days.

00:36:34.770 --> 00:36:36.300
Just needed some rest.

00:36:36.300 --> 00:36:38.600
-However...
-Queen

00:36:39.670 --> 00:36:43.340
overcame a serious illness and recovered.

00:36:43.780 --> 00:36:47.650
This good event needs to be celebrated.

00:36:48.480 --> 00:36:50.850
The case is quite suitable.

00:36:51.420 --> 00:36:52.450
Yes.

00:36:52.450 --> 00:36:56.250
This is my duty both as king and as her husband.

00:36:56.690 --> 00:36:59.320
Your Majesty, this will not work.

00:36:59.760 --> 00:37:02.630
An attempt on the Queen's life is a serious crime.

00:37:02.960 --> 00:37:05.230
If you are in a hurry to arrange a feast...

00:37:05.230 --> 00:37:06.500
Minister of War.

00:37:07.330 --> 00:37:09.670
Aren't you glad the Queen has recovered?

00:37:10.170 --> 00:37:11.440
Really

00:37:11.440 --> 00:37:14.810
did you want the queen to suffer?

00:37:15.310 --> 00:37:17.710
No, of course not.

00:37:18.040 --> 00:37:19.780
Use this case

00:37:20.180 --> 00:37:23.080
more important for political purposes than the queen's health?

00:37:29.420 --> 00:37:31.290
Calm down, Your Majesty.

00:37:31.290 --> 00:37:36.060
If this is your desire,
we will gladly accept your will.

00:37:36.590 --> 00:37:38.060
Then wait.

00:37:39.900 --> 00:37:43.000
You had a good rest. Just overflowing with energy.

00:37:56.380 --> 00:37:57.550
The enemy of my enemy.

00:37:58.050 --> 00:38:00.220
I will defeat a barbarian with another barbarian.

00:38:00.820 --> 00:38:02.220
We need to create a clan

00:38:02.220 --> 00:38:03.790
opposing the Kims.

00:38:04.060 --> 00:38:05.620
-Create?
-We use

00:38:05.620 --> 00:38:07.490
a concubine chosen by the queen.

00:38:10.190 --> 00:38:11.860
Royal chef, look?

00:38:11.860 --> 00:38:14.200
Yes, come on. Does it taste the same?

00:38:14.200 --> 00:38:15.800
Let me try.

00:38:18.700 --> 00:38:20.040
Bring some more seasonings.

00:38:20.040 --> 00:38:21.370
Yes. I'll add a little more.

00:38:22.370 --> 00:38:24.780
No, that won't work, it's watery. Redo it.

00:38:25.610 --> 00:38:27.980
And why are you trying so hard?

00:38:30.350 --> 00:38:33.850
The popularity of milk dishes will only grow.

00:38:34.150 --> 00:38:36.820
We can't starve young calves.

00:38:37.660 --> 00:38:41.760
So I want to replace the milk with something with a similar taste.

00:38:43.960 --> 00:38:46.230
Molecular cuisine in Joseon?

00:38:48.570 --> 00:38:50.940
He tries so hard, especially today.

00:38:52.970 --> 00:38:54.110
Royal chef.

00:38:56.210 --> 00:38:57.810
There is so much sadness in these eyes.

00:38:58.710 --> 00:39:01.610
I'm sure he has a whole family to feed.

00:39:02.350 --> 00:39:03.480
I'm listening to you.

00:39:05.150 --> 00:39:06.680
Light up the fire.

00:39:17.130 --> 00:39:19.660
On these small shoulders of the head of the family

00:39:19.660 --> 00:39:21.400
the burden lies heavy.

00:39:23.900 --> 00:39:25.800
So to think, I still don't know your name.

00:39:25.800 --> 00:39:26.900
What's your name?

00:39:28.510 --> 00:39:29.670
Manbok.

00:39:30.910 --> 00:39:32.280
Tell us about your family.

00:39:32.840 --> 00:39:35.380
I think there are 10 people in your family,
and everyone needs to be fed.

00:39:36.310 --> 00:39:37.450
I'm lonely.

00:39:38.520 --> 00:39:39.550
What?

00:39:39.550 --> 00:39:42.390
I have been enjoying the single life for a long time.

00:39:46.920 --> 00:39:49.290
Don't have a family to feed?

00:39:49.960 --> 00:39:51.130
Think again.

00:39:53.360 --> 00:39:56.570
Well, I sometimes feed stray cats fish heads.

00:39:56.700 --> 00:39:58.800
Right. Do you see?

00:39:59.240 --> 00:40:01.910
Without you, stray cats will starve.

00:40:03.140 --> 00:40:06.180
I'm not doing this for you, but for those stray cats.

00:40:08.680 --> 00:40:10.010
I will share the recipe with you.

00:40:10.410 --> 00:40:13.480
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:40:14.650 --> 00:40:16.050
What are you doing? You're frightening.

00:40:18.560 --> 00:40:21.290
Okay, bring me the paper.

00:40:32.040 --> 00:40:33.140
Hong Young.

00:40:33.140 --> 00:40:35.170
Deliver this to the royal physician.

00:40:35.570 --> 00:40:36.610
Yes.

00:40:44.050 --> 00:40:46.680
Recommend aromatic herbs that are good for the skin.

00:40:47.650 --> 00:40:50.250
If I don't like it, get a new assignment.

00:40:52.420 --> 00:40:54.390
New assignment?

00:40:54.730 --> 00:40:56.430
There's more on the back side.

00:40:58.600 --> 00:41:01.500
I need a eunuch here to choose the royal concubine.

00:41:02.600 --> 00:41:06.500
Why is she always trying to make me a eunuch?

00:41:17.750 --> 00:41:18.780
Your Majesty.

00:41:19.450 --> 00:41:22.050
Take your time. You can hurt yourself this way.

00:41:26.790 --> 00:41:29.290
Where can I find books about royal feasts?

00:41:30.660 --> 00:41:32.900
I'll look for them for you.

00:41:40.740 --> 00:41:43.610
I'm interested in the royal feast at Yeongjo.

00:41:44.580 --> 00:41:45.610
Yes.

00:41:58.360 --> 00:42:00.290
I went to the Seongwonjong hall,

00:42:00.290 --> 00:42:01.930
and they told me that you were heading here.

00:42:02.960 --> 00:42:05.330
To what do I owe the pleasure of seeing you?

00:42:05.830 --> 00:42:09.870
I just thought that we rarely see each other.

00:42:10.500 --> 00:42:12.670
I wanted to talk to you.

00:42:28.190 --> 00:42:29.290
Help yourself.

00:42:42.930 --> 00:42:45.940
Is it because you made the tea yourself?

00:42:46.870 --> 00:42:48.670
The taste is more refined.

00:42:50.940 --> 00:42:54.210
When I look at you, I remember the late king.

00:42:54.750 --> 00:42:59.180
That's why it was hard for me to stay close to you.

00:43:00.050 --> 00:43:03.290
Sorry I didn't realize this earlier.

00:43:03.850 --> 00:43:08.430
I thought I knew a lot about the late king.

00:43:09.330 --> 00:43:11.160
But perhaps the late king,

00:43:13.730 --> 00:43:15.070
my son,

00:43:15.730 --> 00:43:19.270
was a greater king than I thought

00:43:20.300 --> 00:43:21.840
judging by the fact

00:43:21.840 --> 00:43:24.740
how he fought with the Kims for supreme power.

00:43:26.940 --> 00:43:28.780
I blame myself for

00:43:29.310 --> 00:43:32.420
that I couldn’t call on my kind

00:43:33.180 --> 00:43:35.590
support the king and his cause.

00:43:38.420 --> 00:43:40.560
Don't blame yourself.

00:43:40.960 --> 00:43:44.860
I'm sure the late king wouldn't have wanted that.

00:43:45.960 --> 00:43:49.230
I thought that if I could

00:43:49.970 --> 00:43:53.970
fix my mistake with your help?

00:44:18.030 --> 00:44:21.100
In many ways I am inferior to the late king.

00:44:24.470 --> 00:44:25.970
Is it true?

00:44:27.670 --> 00:44:30.570
If you share the late king's goal,

00:44:31.210 --> 00:44:35.180
let me help you.

00:44:36.950 --> 00:44:40.480
I won't repeat my mistake.

00:44:41.420 --> 00:44:43.120
I'll keep this in mind.

00:44:46.220 --> 00:44:50.530
I am very glad that I was able to get to know you a little today.

00:44:50.530 --> 00:44:52.560
Do not mention it.

00:44:53.160 --> 00:44:54.430
I'll leave you.

00:45:07.780 --> 00:45:09.680
I'll be waiting at our usual place.

00:45:31.370 --> 00:45:33.600
His Majesty has arrived.

00:45:40.540 --> 00:45:43.110
Sorry. How long have you been waiting for me?

00:45:43.980 --> 00:45:45.350
Wait outside.

00:45:49.120 --> 00:45:52.260
I thought you wouldn't come, so I came back.

00:45:52.890 --> 00:45:54.530
I read the letter late.

00:45:55.090 --> 00:45:56.330
So you've been busy.

00:45:57.290 --> 00:45:59.060
So much so that they even forgot about the letter.

00:45:59.060 --> 00:46:01.570
In truth, the Queen Mother came

00:46:01.570 --> 00:46:03.000
talk to me.

00:46:05.000 --> 00:46:06.970
What were you talking about?

00:46:07.470 --> 00:46:08.940
Just normal conversation.

00:46:11.380 --> 00:46:12.610
It seems you have

00:46:13.810 --> 00:46:16.850
more and more secrets from me.

00:46:17.850 --> 00:46:20.920
Then what did you discuss with the queen?

00:46:21.550 --> 00:46:23.590
When you were at the lake.

00:46:25.120 --> 00:46:27.730
-Have you seen it?
-Shouldn’t you?

00:46:28.160 --> 00:46:29.330
No.

00:46:29.860 --> 00:46:32.430
We discussed the selection of royal concubines.

00:46:33.960 --> 00:46:35.030
Concubines.

00:46:37.130 --> 00:46:38.570
I'm sure you refused.

00:46:38.970 --> 00:46:41.310
We need to divert the Kims' attention.

00:46:41.310 --> 00:46:43.670
If we pit them against another enemy,

00:46:43.670 --> 00:46:45.680
they will forget about the throne for a while.

00:46:45.680 --> 00:46:48.710
So you agreed to this?

00:46:49.150 --> 00:46:51.920
-Yes.
-This is all the machinations of the queen!

00:46:52.880 --> 00:46:53.950
Royal consort.

00:46:53.950 --> 00:46:56.250
Why do you call me royal consort?

00:46:56.490 --> 00:46:59.190
Why don't you call me by name anymore?

00:47:00.060 --> 00:47:04.760
You said that only I can make you happy or sad.

00:47:05.500 --> 00:47:06.900
But now

00:47:07.260 --> 00:47:09.970
This isn't about me anymore, is it?

00:47:11.170 --> 00:47:14.510
-Hwajin.
-Please tell me how you feel.

00:47:15.570 --> 00:47:16.810
Really

00:47:18.780 --> 00:47:21.150
have you fallen in love with the queen?

00:47:30.820 --> 00:47:32.820
The basis of Western cuisine is sauce and dressing.

00:47:33.090 --> 00:47:35.030
At the same time, refueling is the main highlight.

00:47:35.860 --> 00:47:36.890
Try it.

00:47:38.460 --> 00:47:41.800
If I use this, can I make milk from the beans?

00:47:43.900 --> 00:47:45.040
But why are you alone?

00:47:45.670 --> 00:47:46.700
What?

00:47:49.110 --> 00:47:51.610
I didn't have time to get married because of my constant work.

00:47:52.640 --> 00:47:53.910
What about parents and other relatives?

00:47:55.680 --> 00:47:58.350
In 1839 all Catholics were killed.

00:47:58.350 --> 00:47:59.680
So I was left alone.

00:48:01.920 --> 00:48:04.050
Why did they become Catholics?

00:48:04.760 --> 00:48:07.220
That's why I don't believe in anything.

00:48:08.430 --> 00:48:09.730
Catholic persecution.

00:48:12.430 --> 00:48:13.530
You must be lonely.

00:48:14.700 --> 00:48:16.970
I'm not the only one who ended up like this.

00:48:18.840 --> 00:48:21.640
It's a little sad to spend the holidays alone,

00:48:22.810 --> 00:48:24.170
but the plus is

00:48:25.610 --> 00:48:29.610
that they died on the same day,
so the wake is only once a year.

00:48:37.620 --> 00:48:39.220
What's wrong with all of you?

00:48:39.360 --> 00:48:41.930
How did you know that I am susceptible to the smell of sadness?

00:48:43.430 --> 00:48:45.430
-The smell of sadness?
-The food smells sad.

00:48:46.560 --> 00:48:48.900
When the cook is sad, and the food is saturated with sadness.

00:48:50.200 --> 00:48:51.270
I knew.

00:48:51.570 --> 00:48:53.840
Therefore, whether it be happiness or sadness,

00:48:53.840 --> 00:48:57.040
I left all my emotions at the door,

00:48:57.040 --> 00:48:58.940
before entering the kitchen.

00:48:59.410 --> 00:49:00.910
But you always get angry.

00:49:00.910 --> 00:49:04.520
This is because whenever you come, you upset me.

00:49:06.380 --> 00:49:09.290
Blame yourself for lack of practice. No others are needed.

00:49:09.490 --> 00:49:11.760
Just look at this one.

00:49:11.760 --> 00:49:12.990
Look at this one?

00:49:13.560 --> 00:49:14.730
Did you say "this"?

00:49:14.930 --> 00:49:16.490
Look at you.

00:49:17.960 --> 00:49:19.200
It's even worse!

00:49:19.800 --> 00:49:21.900
I should have let you be killed.

00:49:23.030 --> 00:49:25.270
I'm so kind.

00:49:38.120 --> 00:49:40.450
I just ate.

00:49:41.420 --> 00:49:42.750
I don’t know why.

00:49:54.430 --> 00:49:57.230
This is not for food. Attach

00:49:57.970 --> 00:49:59.440
to your face.

00:50:01.910 --> 00:50:04.380
This is how I will become indispensable:

00:50:05.280 --> 00:50:07.950
Korean food and Korean self-care.

00:50:13.520 --> 00:50:15.890
The weather is perfect for drying vegetables.

00:50:36.070 --> 00:50:37.170
Your Majesty.

00:50:38.180 --> 00:50:40.540
I didn't see you yesterday.

00:50:40.540 --> 00:50:43.110
I hope you didn't have a bad hangover.

00:50:50.750 --> 00:50:52.660
Sorry for leaving my post.

00:50:54.190 --> 00:50:56.190
I'd like to talk to you.

00:50:58.100 --> 00:51:00.960
Remember what happened before
How did you fall into a vegetative state?

00:51:01.370 --> 00:51:04.600
Have you noticed anything or anyone suspicious?

00:51:05.100 --> 00:51:07.200
Under someone suspicious

00:51:07.370 --> 00:51:09.540
who do you mean?

00:51:09.640 --> 00:51:10.970
Anyone.

00:51:11.210 --> 00:51:13.710
Well, to be honest,

00:51:13.710 --> 00:51:16.510
I think my condition was associated with otherworldly forces.

00:51:16.510 --> 00:51:19.280
Under otherworldly forces
do you mean enemy?

00:51:19.280 --> 00:51:20.480
No.

00:51:22.220 --> 00:51:26.690
I mean it happened naturally.

00:51:27.690 --> 00:51:30.190
You will be shocked, but I will say it anyway.

00:51:30.860 --> 00:51:33.430
I suspect the king is involved in this.

00:51:34.200 --> 00:51:36.200
According to the investigation,

00:51:36.200 --> 00:51:38.200
the man who attacked you at Octajeong,

00:51:39.270 --> 00:51:41.470
was sent by His Majesty.

00:51:42.640 --> 00:51:44.440
Knew you'd be shocked.

00:51:44.940 --> 00:51:46.110
How did you know?

00:51:46.810 --> 00:51:48.250
Only I know about this.

00:51:49.280 --> 00:51:50.950
Did you know?

00:51:51.920 --> 00:51:53.380
Well, here's the thing.

00:51:54.080 --> 00:51:56.090
Everything is very confusing

00:51:56.090 --> 00:51:58.120
So we decided to forget about this incident.

00:51:58.120 --> 00:52:01.060
And you behaved as if nothing had happened?

00:52:01.560 --> 00:52:04.760
You keep loving him
despite what he did?

00:52:05.130 --> 00:52:07.330
What? Love?

00:52:07.870 --> 00:52:10.500
What an abomination!

00:52:11.130 --> 00:52:14.400
I want to live here happily
must get along with the king.

00:52:14.510 --> 00:52:16.610
I have no choice!

00:52:16.610 --> 00:52:17.880
Then how could you...

00:52:17.880 --> 00:52:18.980
I'm already confused

00:52:18.980 --> 00:52:20.480
and you're talking about love here.

00:52:22.350 --> 00:52:24.210
How is the choice of concubines?

00:52:24.550 --> 00:52:25.750
Lady Choi!

00:52:25.980 --> 00:52:27.280
Lady Choi!

00:52:35.320 --> 00:52:37.720
Girls, I'm here!..

00:52:40.160 --> 00:52:41.960
Where are the candidates?

00:52:42.630 --> 00:52:45.300
They are here.

00:52:56.780 --> 00:52:57.780
What is this?

00:52:57.780 --> 00:52:59.910
I was so looking forward to this.

00:53:01.680 --> 00:53:04.920
What's up?

00:53:22.170 --> 00:53:26.040
I can't give up the kaleidoscope.

00:53:35.050 --> 00:53:37.920
She went this far for our family?

00:53:47.030 --> 00:53:49.100
Once again, what is it called?

00:53:50.030 --> 00:53:52.230
She called it the veil of beauty.

00:53:52.700 --> 00:53:54.770
I was looking for someone to replace her,

00:53:55.170 --> 00:53:57.470
and she gave me new care.

00:54:00.110 --> 00:54:01.740
Your Majesty.

00:54:01.740 --> 00:54:03.380
This is the head of the Detective Department, Kim Byungin.

00:54:05.310 --> 00:54:06.580
At this hour?

00:54:08.980 --> 00:54:10.120
Come in.

00:54:26.370 --> 00:54:28.840
I mentioned you to my brother, so he told you to come,

00:54:29.270 --> 00:54:31.040
but now it's too late.

00:54:31.240 --> 00:54:33.370
I have not received such a message.

00:54:34.840 --> 00:54:37.180
I dared to insist on meeting with you, as I must

00:54:37.540 --> 00:54:40.180
say something around your father.

00:54:42.450 --> 00:54:43.650
Perhaps my father

00:54:44.850 --> 00:54:47.190
said that His Majesty is different from his predecessor.

00:54:49.990 --> 00:54:51.890
But he was wrong.

00:55:08.240 --> 00:55:09.280
What?

00:55:12.480 --> 00:55:13.480
No...

00:55:17.050 --> 00:55:18.920
Don't follow me.

00:55:24.120 --> 00:55:25.530
This is so, a trifle.

00:55:26.960 --> 00:55:28.330
A little red ginseng.

00:55:28.930 --> 00:55:31.360
-Here, take it.
-Thank you.

00:55:34.000 --> 00:55:38.110
By the way, is everything okay?

00:55:38.110 --> 00:55:39.910
With what?

00:55:40.710 --> 00:55:43.040
There is no need to talk in riddles, get to the point.

00:55:43.040 --> 00:55:44.980
What are you talking about?

00:55:45.650 --> 00:55:48.880
I was just wondering how things were going.

00:55:50.550 --> 00:55:55.460
I assume Byonin is still in the palace?

00:56:03.560 --> 00:56:05.130
Greetings.

00:56:06.430 --> 00:56:08.900
-I'm back.
-You're late today.

00:56:08.900 --> 00:56:12.370
There is never time to just be with colleagues,

00:56:12.370 --> 00:56:14.040
So I drank with them at the Detective Department.

00:56:14.510 --> 00:56:15.580
Fine.

00:56:16.180 --> 00:56:18.510
It's a little late. Go get some rest.

00:56:19.010 --> 00:56:21.680
Okay, back to your conversation.

00:56:22.780 --> 00:56:25.250
Fine. Good night.

00:56:30.490 --> 00:56:32.230
-Minister
-Yes.

00:56:32.990 --> 00:56:34.490
Look worried.

00:56:35.900 --> 00:56:39.330
Biting more than you can chew will make you nervous.

00:56:39.330 --> 00:56:42.400
What... I don't quite understand.

00:56:42.940 --> 00:56:44.270
Don't understand that you can

00:56:44.270 --> 00:56:48.110
bring disaster upon yourself and the queen with your recklessness?

00:56:48.340 --> 00:56:49.940
If I'm worried, it's because

00:56:51.110 --> 00:56:53.880
that it was not possible to capture the one who attacked the queen.

00:56:55.280 --> 00:56:58.320
-Is this so?
- Well, it’s already late.

00:56:58.320 --> 00:56:59.890
You must be tired.

00:57:00.650 --> 00:57:03.020
I just came by to give you a gift.

00:57:03.490 --> 00:57:04.860
It's time for me to go.

00:57:12.330 --> 00:57:14.400
He lost the ledger.

00:57:15.070 --> 00:57:17.300
If he had nothing to do with it, does it mean that Benin acted on his own?

00:57:18.270 --> 00:57:19.440
And if not...

00:57:20.670 --> 00:57:21.710
Really?

00:57:49.070 --> 00:57:52.010
Thank you it's not me.

00:57:53.810 --> 00:57:56.340
It took a long time

00:57:56.880 --> 00:57:58.850
find a similar body.

00:57:59.080 --> 00:58:00.780
Tell me about it.

00:58:00.780 --> 00:58:02.550
She drowned.

00:58:02.550 --> 00:58:06.750
The face is unrecognizable because it was in the water for a long time.

00:58:11.160 --> 00:58:13.930
Please tell me how you feel.

00:58:15.960 --> 00:58:17.130
Are you really

00:58:19.170 --> 00:58:21.330
fell in love with the queen?

00:58:27.340 --> 00:58:28.380
I

00:58:30.940 --> 00:58:33.210
shouldn't love the queen.

00:58:35.680 --> 00:58:37.420
Don't deny that you're in love.

00:58:38.650 --> 00:58:40.390
Just say that you shouldn’t love.

00:58:55.170 --> 00:58:57.300
Your Highness, Prince Yeonpyeong is here.

00:58:58.170 --> 00:58:59.640
Yes, come in.

00:59:08.180 --> 00:59:09.920
I apologize for the late visit.

00:59:09.920 --> 00:59:11.180
I have the news you've been waiting for.

00:59:12.190 --> 00:59:13.690
Have you found Ovol?

00:59:25.000 --> 00:59:27.230
Did you give this to her?

00:59:28.770 --> 00:59:31.340
Yes, this is my gift.

00:59:31.340 --> 00:59:34.170
The court lady sold it.

00:59:37.140 --> 00:59:40.110
This means Ovol is alive. What a blessing.

00:59:41.920 --> 00:59:44.720
Why send me for water in the middle of the night?

00:59:45.950 --> 00:59:47.550
Previously, they couldn’t ask.

00:59:57.060 --> 00:59:58.300
Is there something stuck there?

01:00:02.600 --> 01:00:03.940
What is this?

01:00:17.680 --> 01:00:20.290
I hired an artist to paint a portrait of that lady.

01:00:20.620 --> 01:00:22.320
As soon as we see it, we'll know for sure.

01:00:29.660 --> 01:00:32.500
I really thought of a way to help the king...

01:00:32.500 --> 01:00:33.530
Your Highness.

01:00:35.540 --> 01:00:36.700
In the well...

01:00:37.670 --> 01:00:40.110
-In the well?
-They found a body there.

01:00:40.110 --> 01:00:43.540
Looks like Ovol, your maid.

01:00:44.180 --> 01:00:45.180
Ovol?

01:00:48.250 --> 01:00:49.350
-What should we do?
- That's the problem.

01:00:59.760 --> 01:01:01.190
It may hurt you.

01:01:01.660 --> 01:01:03.460
-Let me...
-No.

01:01:04.300 --> 01:01:06.400
I have to see for myself.

01:01:42.000 --> 01:01:43.340
-Did you see this?
-This is terrible.

01:01:45.540 --> 01:01:47.840
Looks like she's been underwater for a long time.

01:01:48.980 --> 01:01:52.950
I understand how painful it must be.

01:02:19.940 --> 01:02:21.070
Please stop.

01:02:22.810 --> 01:02:24.540
I've just started.

01:02:24.940 --> 01:02:25.950
Your Highness.

01:02:27.480 --> 01:02:28.980
I want to be alone.

01:03:11.660 --> 01:03:12.860
That,

01:03:14.090 --> 01:03:16.160
who makes me happy and sad.

01:03:17.700 --> 01:03:20.730
Your Majesty, the Queen Dowager is here.

01:03:29.810 --> 01:03:31.010
What brought you here?

01:03:42.320 --> 01:03:44.390
What have you been reading?

01:03:44.990 --> 01:03:47.930
So, one of the appeals that I missed.

01:03:47.930 --> 01:03:50.600
You look more animated than usual

01:03:51.300 --> 01:03:53.330
So I’m curious how I spent my time outside the palace.

01:03:53.330 --> 01:03:54.870
That's what I came to ask about.

01:03:55.200 --> 01:03:56.970
It was good to forget for a while

01:03:56.970 --> 01:03:58.710
about palace affairs.

01:04:00.110 --> 01:04:01.240
Glad to hear that.

01:04:04.480 --> 01:04:05.480
You know,

01:04:06.410 --> 01:04:08.980
I wish you happiness.

01:04:12.390 --> 01:04:13.620
Very grateful.

01:04:14.350 --> 01:04:17.290
You've been through so much.

01:04:18.830 --> 01:04:20.290
Have you already forgotten everything?

01:04:21.630 --> 01:04:24.500
You can inherit destiny.

01:04:25.570 --> 01:04:28.130
You will learn to be grateful for your situation and do nothing,

01:04:28.130 --> 01:04:32.340
you and those you love will remain safe.

01:04:33.510 --> 01:04:36.910
So why can't you just sit and do nothing?

01:04:40.250 --> 01:04:43.180
Be smart, king.

01:04:46.250 --> 01:04:48.760
I will, Your Majesty.

01:05:20.290 --> 01:05:21.950
Secret

01:05:49.280 --> 01:05:50.880
Be smart

01:05:51.620 --> 01:05:52.790
my baby.

01:06:35.230 --> 01:06:37.760
Some live in a nightmare.

01:07:02.020 --> 01:07:05.190
Queen's Dictionary.

01:07:11.300 --> 01:07:14.430
Social distancing

01:07:18.870 --> 01:07:23.080
That means everyone is on their own.

01:07:25.310 --> 01:07:29.120
Antifan: powerful spiritual guide

01:07:29.120 --> 01:07:31.520
fan, social networks, phone,

01:07:31.520 --> 01:07:33.120
showdown, let's light it up,

01:07:33.120 --> 01:07:34.890
special forces, lottery, jackpot.

01:07:38.490 --> 01:07:39.830
But they often find

01:07:40.260 --> 01:07:42.860
their own are able to overcome nightmares.

01:08:13.690 --> 01:08:15.900
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

01:08:16.060 --> 01:08:17.600
Come to us.

01:08:17.600 --> 01:08:18.730
Come to us soon.

01:08:18.730 --> 01:08:19.870
Well, come here.

01:08:33.980 --> 01:08:35.950
But it's worth only pleasant dreams

01:08:36.420 --> 01:08:38.620
banish your nightmare...

01:08:45.060 --> 01:08:47.430
-I want a hug too.
-And you?

01:08:47.890 --> 01:08:49.360
Fine.

01:08:52.000 --> 01:08:53.170
-Bliss!
-Queen.

01:08:56.100 --> 01:08:58.300
New nightmare

01:08:59.310 --> 01:09:01.510
finds you.

01:09:02.340 --> 01:09:03.440
Your Majesty.

01:09:04.640 --> 01:09:09.250
Has she lost her voice, is she hoarse, should you call me?

01:09:13.520 --> 01:09:15.660
Why the hell are you forgetting here?

01:09:18.160 --> 01:09:19.330
My queen.

01:09:23.230 --> 01:09:24.560
Today

01:09:25.930 --> 01:09:27.900
no social distancing.

01:10:01.400 --> 01:10:04.200
Is this my heart? Or is the body asking?

01:10:05.470 --> 01:10:06.670
Director Han?

01:10:06.840 --> 01:10:08.370
Everything is rotten!

01:10:08.370 --> 01:10:11.280
We will do everything to get the ingredients.

01:10:11.280 --> 01:10:15.350
The king wants to look strong on Cart Day.

01:10:15.350 --> 01:10:16.520
Fire!

01:10:17.550 --> 01:10:20.490
There are always those who take competitions so seriously.

01:10:20.490 --> 01:10:21.490
What kind of glare is this?

01:10:21.490 --> 01:10:23.660
So I have to teach you a lesson.

01:10:23.660 --> 01:10:25.160
I'll show you who's boss in the palace.

01:10:25.160 --> 01:10:26.830
I won't forgive you.
